alue is 1\n- For other cases, the value is 2. And in these cases, you can fill the "download_failed_reason_detail" field with what you think the download failed for.\n- If download successfully, the "download_failed_reason_detail" field should be empty.', 'observations': ['Step Answer: [\n\t{\n\t\t"name": "±ÌÀ¶Ö®º£",\n\t\t"search_name": "±ÌÀ¶Ö®º£",\n\t\t"chapter": 11,\n\t\t"update_date": 1,\n\t\t"fansub_name": ""\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\t"name": "³ÁÄ¬Ä§Å®µÄÃØÃÜ",\n\t\t"search_name": "³ÁÄ¬Ä§Å®µÄÃØÃÜ",\n\t\t"chapter": 11,\n\t\t"update_date": 5,\n\t\t"fansub_name": ""\n\t}\n]'], 'resources': [], 'plan_iterations': 1, 'current_plan': Plan(locale='en-US', has_enough_context=False, thought='The user wants to search for torrent links and download anime. The steps include retrieving information from a JSON file, searching for magnet links on a webpage, downloading the files using BitComet, and scanning a folder to check for newly added download files. I will break down these steps into more detailed tasks.', title='Anime Torrent Download Task', steps=[Step(need_search=False, title='Retrieve information from JSON file', description="Call the tool to retrieve information from the file D:\\animate\\animate_storage.json, which contains a JSON string. Format the output as 'Step Answer: [json]'.", step_type=<StepType.TASK_SOLVER: 'task_solver'>, execution_res='Step Answer: [\n\t{\n\t\t"name": "±ÌÀ¶Ö®º£",\n\t\t"search_name": "±ÌÀ¶Ö®º£",\n\t\t"chapter": 11,\n\t\t"update_date": 1,\n\t\t"fansub_name": ""\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\t"name": "³ÁÄ¬Ä§Å®µÄÃØÃÜ",\n\t\t"search_name": "³ÁÄ¬Ä§Å®µÄÃØÃÜ",\n\t\t"chapter": 11,\n\t\t"update_date": 5,\n\t\t"fansub_name": ""\n\t}\n]'), Step(need_search=True, title='Search for magnet links', description="For each element in the JSON array obtained from the first step, search for magnet links on the webpage https://www.comicat.org/search.php?keyword={search_name}. Use the request header {'User - Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML,